mlxflow 0.8
1. Read CSV        survey.csv
2. Query Table     columns=comment
3. Table to Text   format=csv
4. Split           by=lines   text -> [text]
5. <each tag_one; on_error=skip>   [text] -> [text]
     1. Classify   (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "Sentiment? tags: pos, neu, neg"
        -> { pos: 2 | neu: 3 | neg: 4 }
     2. Template   (input:1)   "POS  {1}"
        -> 5
     3. Template   (input:1)   "NEU  {1}"
        -> 5
     4. Template   (input:1)   "NEG  {1}"
     5. Template               "{1}"
6. Filter          contains="NEG"
7. Summarize       Qwen3 8B; "Top 5 complaint themes, one example quote
                   each"
8. Save Text       complaint-themes.md
